      "url": "https://philpapers.org/rec/YABKOR",
      "philpapers_id": "YABKOR",
      "snippet": "These are (1) the completeness of the character of the White race and (2) the dispossession of the character of the beauty and the dignity of the Negro race. Then I demonstrate that the \u201corthodox reading\u201d has failed because it has adopted an apologetic approach. This approach, I argue, is misrepresentative in some significant respects. It ultimately leads to a failure to note that the notion of \u201cCharakteristik,\u201d which is predetermined by Kant\u2019s conception of natural predispositions, is the cornerstone of the theory.",
